http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Altar#Ordinary_sacrifice

Basically, if:

* the altar is co-aligned;
* your XL is at least 3;
* your alignment record and luck are non-negative (this'll fix itself 
in a long enough sacfest);
* your deity is not angry with you;
* your prayer timeout has expired; and
* you're not sacrificing a creature of your own race, a former pet, or 
any unicorn...

...you have a 1/(10+2�A�G), where A is the total number of artifacts 
generated in that game, and G is the number of gifts you have already 
received from sacrificing. So, if you haven't received any gifts, 
you'll have a 1/10 chance of getting a gift if all of the above 
conditions are met; similarly, if you've received 2 gifts and one other 
artifact has been generated, you'll have a 1/(10+2x3x2), or 1/22 
chance.


